resolution cache: 55 runs; cold stores, warm reuses all and checks equal; a comment re-resolves one module, a signature its dependents, an option all; a damaged or corrupt entry is a miss; lines above, a move and another checkout reuse all; changed text, a rename and a new naming prefix re-resolve the modules they change; the program's widest tuple leaves other modules cacheable; export sets, datatype updates and refinement copies are cached, and an export edit re-resolves its module
